SURVIVORSHIP -- read this before anything below it.
A strike pinned at entry is only quoted while spot stays near it, so an exit
that fails to price is missing BECAUSE the market ran away from the strike.
Moneyness is spot at the bell in units of the strike gap above the short
strike: 0 means it finished at the short strike, >1 means both legs are ITM
and the spread closed at its maximum loss.
